    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Dr Munira Amirali, Assistant Professor at AKU-IED, received the prestigious award of Fellow of the Higher Education Academy (FHEA), UK. Her fellow application to TEACH (AKU) was reviewed by three peer assessors including an external moderator. Her work evidenced that she met the standards of the UK Professional Standards Framework. Dr Munira is now included in the pool of 127,000+ HEA fellows across the globe.",
